Package: medion-g24-speakers
Version: 0.1.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Medion G24 speakers contributors <314253099+maik-sch-droid@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), systemd, init-system-helpers (>= 1.56), kmod
Description: Restore the internal speakers on a hardware-matched Medion G24
 This startup service checks the tested Medion G24 mainboard and BIOS, then
 applies a verified SMBus register correction for silent internal speakers.
 A systemd timer starts the check during boot.
